// Title: Sysinternals PsService Execution
// Rule ID: 3371f518-5fe3-4cf6-a14b-2a0ae3fd8a4f
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.discovery, attack.persistence, attack.t1543.003
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
